<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>W</strong>e are watching<br />
<strong>E</strong>ars a plenty<br />
<strong>L</strong>aying in wait<br />
<strong>I</strong> am among you<br />
<strong>V</strong>engeance is what I seek<br />
<strong>E</strong>veryone’s future seemingly bleak.<br />
