<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. Bones will not stick to the SCP-5234, but if left unchecked will start to consume calcium if still in contact with SCP-5234. Hair also seems unaffected during this process.</div>
