<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. After the recent onsite breach, it is necessary to check all safety equipment before coming into contact with SCP-5234 to prevent a potential containment breach.</div>
